  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] **__Shortcut Trick__ **\n\nlet x = y = z = 1\n\nSo, p = 1/2, q = 1/2, z = 1/2\n\nNow,\n\n(1)/(2+2p) + (1)/(2+2q)+(1)/(2+2r)\n\n⇒ (1)/(2+1) + (1)/(2+1)+(1)/(2+1)\n\n⇒ (1)/(3) + (1)/(3)+(1)/(3) = 1\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c76c13ba2d2ab46b47f8a931ae621dac081a0cb266b142dc23f58659fac4a466.png] **__Alternate Method__**\n\n**Calculation**\n\n(1)/(2+2p) + (1)/(2+2q)+(1)/(2+2r)\n\n⇒ 1/(2 + 2 × (x/y + z)) + 1/(2 + 2 × (y/x+ z)) + 1/(2 + 2 × (z/x+ y))\n\n⇒ [(y + z)/2x + 2y + 2z] + [(x + z)/2x + 2y + 2z] + [(y + x)/2x + 2y + 2z]\n\n⇒ (2x + 2y + 2z)/(2x + 2y + 2z)\n\n⇒ 1\n\n**The value is 1.**",
